From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:10:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor: ed_dds_thumb can start from a mip level (4th
 argument), DDS decoder moved to EdDdsDecode.h with a level decoder and test

A 2048 x 2048 layer texture was decoded in full (4 million texels, ~27 ms in the test) to make a 96 x 96 picture; with mips > 0 the reduction starts from the smallest level
that is still twice the thumbnail wide (256 x 256: 0.4 ms). Default behaviour unchanged; the fourth return value is the width decoded.

